// Source: Locally authored (generic Power Platform App Insights queries)
// Daily dependency call volume + average duration for the last 30 days, broken down by type.
// Typical types on a Dataverse-backed App Insights resource:
//   Plugin, SDK Retrieve, SDK RetrieveMultiple, UCI REQUEST, Http, Azure blob, Ajax, etc.
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(30d)
| summarize Calls = count(), AvgMs = avg(duration) by bin(timestamp, 1d), type
| render timechart
